"""Patch files applied to third-party crates via `crate.annotation`.

When upstream lands the equivalent fix, delete the patch file and
remove the matching `crate.annotation(patches=...)` in MODULE.bazel.

Patch authoring rules:
- Use `-p1` (unified diff with one leading path component).
- Keep patches minimal — only the lines needed for Bazel sandbox parity.
- The header comment in the patch must explain *why* (which sandbox /
  Bazel behavior the upstream code conflicts with).
"""

package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])

exports_files(glob(["*.patch"]))
